WEBVTT

00:01.025 --> 00:03.956
<i>[ukulele music]</i>
<i>[尤克里里音乐]</i>

00:04.025 --> 00:11.197
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.163 --> 00:14.094
I'm Karen, the Blue Fairy.
我是蓝精灵凯伦。

00:14.163 --> 00:18.128
And this tale lacks class,
for it's the story of...
这个故事缺乏阶级性，
因为它的故事是...

00:18.197 --> 00:20.197
<i>[mystical chiming]</i>
<i>[神秘的鸣响]</i>

00:20.266 --> 00:23.784
"The Big Bad Bubble Bass."
“大坏蛋泡泡鲈鱼。”

00:23.853 --> 00:25.818
<i>[gentle music]</i>
<i>[轻柔的音乐]</i>

00:25.887 --> 00:29.301
[snoring]
[打鼾]

00:29.370 --> 00:30.404
[clock ticking]
[时钟滴答作响]

00:30.473 --> 00:33.266
Evil! Evil!
[alarm ringing]
邪恶的！邪恶的！
[警报响起]

00:33.335 --> 00:34.266
Hmm.
唔。

00:34.335 --> 00:36.542
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

00:36.611 --> 00:37.404
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:37.473 --> 00:39.922
Oh, rapturous day!
哦，喜气洋洋的一天！

00:39.991 --> 00:43.439
Today my collection
will be completed.
今天我的收藏
将完成。

00:43.508 --> 00:45.922
At long last, Pigulon,
最后，皮古隆，

00:45.991 --> 00:50.508
leader of the Swine Force 3
Action Team, will be mine.
猪部队3的领导者
行动小组，将是我的。

00:50.577 --> 00:53.335
And I know just what to wear.
我知道穿什么。

00:53.404 --> 00:54.404
Ah. <i>
[wolf howling]</i>
啊。 <我>
[狼嚎]</i>

00:54.473 --> 00:56.853
Behold, Wolfman Boy,
看哪，狼人男孩，

00:56.922 --> 01:00.232
mortal enemy
of the Swine Force 3.
死敌
猪部队3.

01:00.301 --> 01:04.163
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

01:04.232 --> 01:05.542
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:05.611 --> 01:06.611
[growls]
[咆哮]

01:06.646 --> 01:09.887
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:11.335 --> 01:13.611
Ohh!
哦！

01:13.680 --> 01:16.059
<i>Hours later, as the story goes,</i>
<i>几个小时后，随着故事的发展，</i>

01:16.128 --> 01:19.404
<i>Bubble Bass arrived
still adjusting his clothes.</i>
<i>泡泡鲈来了
还在整理衣服。</i>

01:20.956 --> 01:22.128
[laughs]
Hmm?
[笑]
嗯？

01:22.197 --> 01:24.818
<i>[buzzer blares]</i>
Sold out?
<i>[蜂鸣声]</i>
卖完了？

01:24.887 --> 01:26.439
Sorry?
对不起？

01:26.508 --> 01:28.508
Not really?
并不真地？

01:28.577 --> 01:31.163
Oh, this can't be happening!
哦，这不可能发生！

01:31.232 --> 01:34.784
Without Pigulon my life is over.
没有 Pigulon 我的生命就结束了。

01:34.853 --> 01:36.542
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

01:36.611 --> 01:38.025
Oh, boy, Patrick.
哦，男孩，帕特里克。

01:38.094 --> 01:40.818
I can't believe
we got the very last Pigulon.
我不敢相信
我们得到了最后一只皮古龙。

01:40.887 --> 01:46.025
Yeah.
Let's play with him.
是的。
我们和他一起玩吧。

01:46.094 --> 01:48.749
Ahh!
啊！

01:48.818 --> 01:51.404
Not Pigulon's
precious packaging.
不是皮古隆的
珍贵的包装。

01:51.473 --> 01:53.508
There goes half his value!
他的身价就这样消失了一半！

01:53.577 --> 01:55.922
Hmm.
[chuckles]
唔。
[笑声]

01:55.991 --> 01:57.232
It's a good scratcher.
这是一个很好的刮刮器。

01:57.301 --> 02:00.991
Ugh.
啊。

02:01.059 --> 02:02.404
There goes the other half.
另一半就这样过去了。

02:02.473 --> 02:03.956
This cannot stand.
这是站不住脚的。

02:04.025 --> 02:05.646
I must liberate Pigulon
我必须解放皮古隆

02:05.715 --> 02:08.818
from the clutches
of those buffoons.
从离合器
那些小丑。

02:08.887 --> 02:09.887
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:09.922 --> 02:11.163
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

02:11.232 --> 02:13.232
Pardon me, good sirs.
请原谅我，好先生们。

02:13.301 --> 02:17.853
I couldn't help but notice
your Pigulon action figure.
我忍不住注意到
你的 Pigulon 人偶。

02:17.922 --> 02:20.922
Might I buy, trade, or swindle
him from you?
我可以购买、交易或诈骗吗
他离你而去？

02:20.991 --> 02:23.335
Oh, he's all yours, Bubble Bass.
哦，他是你的了，泡泡巴斯。

02:23.404 --> 02:24.887
Anything for a friend.
为了朋友什么都可以。

02:24.956 --> 02:25.956
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:25.991 --> 02:27.094
Hey, wait!
嘿，等等！

02:27.163 --> 02:29.128
I wanna play with the pig man.
我想和猪猪侠一起玩

02:29.197 --> 02:30.439
He's mine too!
他也是我的了！

02:30.508 --> 02:32.680
Oh, sorry.
I forgot.
哦，抱歉。
我忘了。

02:32.749 --> 02:35.473
Patrick and I both chipped in
to buy Pigulon.
帕特里克和我都参与了
购买皮古隆。

02:35.542 --> 02:37.094
Welp, see you later.
好吧，稍后见。

02:37.163 --> 02:40.266
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:40.335 --> 02:42.301
By the gods of nerd-dom
书呆子王国之神

02:42.370 --> 02:45.163
I will acquire that Pigulon.
我会得到那只皮古隆。

02:45.232 --> 02:46.818
No matter what!
无论！

02:46.887 --> 02:50.439
So Bubble Bass plotted,
his courage he'd found,
于是泡泡巴斯策划了，
他找到的勇气，

02:50.508 --> 02:53.439
as he ranted and raved
with no one around.
当他咆哮和咆哮时
周围没有人。

02:53.508 --> 02:55.473
- Be gone, vile machine!
- Uh-oh!
- 走开，邪恶的机器！
- 呃哦！

02:55.542 --> 02:59.473
I have a toy to rescue.
我有一个玩具要拯救。

02:59.542 --> 03:00.749
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

03:00.818 --> 03:03.301
Oh, hello, mysterious stranger.
哦，你好，神秘的陌生人。

03:03.370 --> 03:05.094
How may I help you?
我可以怎样帮助您？

03:05.163 --> 03:06.715
The Toy Inspector.
玩具检验员。

03:06.784 --> 03:08.922
I'll have to take
any dangerous toys
我必须采取
任何危险的玩具

03:08.991 --> 03:12.508
found on your premises back
to the station for questioning.
在您的场所找到回来
到车站询问。

03:12.577 --> 03:14.232
Dangerous toys?
危险玩具？

03:14.301 --> 03:15.887
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:15.956 --> 03:19.059
You better come in right away!
- Uh.
你最好马上进来！
- 呃。

03:19.128 --> 03:21.163
[gasping]
[喘气]

03:21.232 --> 03:22.991
Yes, now where do you keep
是的，现在你在哪里

03:23.059 --> 03:25.853
your meager allotment
of playthings?
你微薄的分配
的玩具？

03:25.922 --> 03:27.473
Oh, over here in the vault.
哦，在金库这里。

03:27.542 --> 03:29.197
Uh, vault?
呃，金库？

03:29.266 --> 03:31.818
[keypad beeping]
[键盘蜂鸣声]

03:31.887 --> 03:33.991
Ahh.
啊。

03:35.404 --> 03:37.542
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:37.611 --> 03:39.956
<i>[light flute music]</i>
<i>[轻笛音乐]</i>

03:40.025 --> 03:41.025
[steam hissing]
[蒸汽嘶嘶声]

03:41.059 --> 03:43.473
[vault rattling]
[金库嘎嘎作响]

03:46.059 --> 03:47.646
- [groans]
- Let's start, shall we?
- [呻吟]
- 我们开始吧，好吗？

03:47.715 --> 03:49.577
We've got a lot of toys
to get through.
我们有很多玩具
才能通过。

03:49.646 --> 03:51.611
Luckily, I alphabetized them.
幸运的是，我按字母顺序排列了它们。

03:51.680 --> 03:53.404
This is Aaron Aardvark.
这是亚伦·土豚。

03:53.473 --> 03:55.301
Is he dangerous?
他危险吗？

03:55.370 --> 03:57.163
Ow!
噢！

03:57.232 --> 03:58.715
No.
不。

03:58.784 --> 04:00.853
This is Abbie Aardvark.
这是艾比·土豚。

04:00.922 --> 04:03.439
Is she dangerous?
她危险吗？

04:03.508 --> 04:05.439
Ouch!
No.
哎哟!
不。

04:05.508 --> 04:06.853
This is Albert Aardvark.
这是阿尔伯特·土豚。

04:06.922 --> 04:07.956
Is he dangerous?
他危险吗？

04:08.025 --> 04:09.956
No. It's fine!
不，没关系！

04:10.025 --> 04:12.197
[groans]
[flames crackling]
[呻吟]
[火焰噼啪作响]

04:14.611 --> 04:16.163
And on to the Ps.
继续讲 Ps。

04:16.232 --> 04:17.542
This is Porktastic Pigulon.
这是Porktastic Pigulon。

04:17.611 --> 04:18.680
Is he dangerous?
他危险吗？

04:18.749 --> 04:20.611
[gasps]
Oh, yes!
[喘气]
哦，是的！

04:20.680 --> 04:21.853
He's very dang...
他真是太牛了...

04:21.922 --> 04:23.853
Oops!
I went out of order.
哎呀！
我出了故障。

04:23.922 --> 04:25.577
This is Perilous Percival.
这是危险的珀西瓦尔。

04:25.646 --> 04:27.094
Is he dangerous?
他危险吗？

04:27.163 --> 04:28.232
Uh...
呃...

04:28.301 --> 04:31.370
ahh-ahh!
啊啊啊！

04:31.439 --> 04:33.301
[fireworks booming]
[烟花爆竹]

04:33.370 --> 04:35.508
both: Ooh.
两人：哦。

04:36.542 --> 04:38.439
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

04:38.508 --> 04:39.922
Yes, hello.
是的，你好。

04:39.991 --> 04:42.025
I'm a world-famous ghost hunter.
我是世界闻名的幽灵猎人。

04:42.094 --> 04:44.542
And I've detected
a massive haunting
我发现
一个巨大的困扰

04:44.611 --> 04:46.887
occurring within your domicile.
发生在您的住所内。

04:46.956 --> 04:50.853
I'll have to scan your home
to pinpoint the possessed item.
我得扫描你的家
精确定位所拥有的物品。

04:50.922 --> 04:51.956
both: Ooh.
两人：哦。

04:52.025 --> 04:55.266
Mm-hmm.
Lots of ghost activity.
嗯嗯。
鬼活动多。

04:55.335 --> 04:56.335
There is?
有？

04:56.370 --> 04:57.508
Yes.
是的。

04:57.577 --> 04:58.818
Beep, beep, beep.
嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟。

04:58.887 --> 05:00.473
[gasps]
[both gasp]
[喘气]
[两人都喘气]

05:00.542 --> 05:02.587
Beep, beep, beep, beep, beep,
beep, beep, beep, beep, beep.
嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，
嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟。

05:02.611 --> 05:04.508
This is it!
This item contains
就是这样！
该商品包含

05:04.577 --> 05:06.232
a malevolent spirit!
恶毒的灵魂！

05:06.301 --> 05:08.956
both: Oh, no, not Pigulon!
两人：哦，不，不是皮古隆！

05:09.025 --> 05:10.473
I'll have to take him back
to the lab
我得把他带回来
到实验室

05:10.542 --> 05:12.370
for spectral containment.
用于光谱遏制。

05:12.439 --> 05:14.197
[chuckles]
No need.
[笑声]
不需要。

05:14.266 --> 05:17.232
Yeah, we'll banish that ghost
for you right here!
是的，我们会驱逐那个幽灵
就在这里为您服务！

05:17.301 --> 05:19.646
both: Alsi kun-sushi
两者：Alsi kun-sushi

05:19.715 --> 05:22.301
ilani amshiti!
伊拉尼·阿姆什蒂！

05:22.370 --> 05:26.542
Alsi ku nushi ilani mushiti!
Alsi ku nushi ilani mushiti！
Alsi ku nushi ilani mushiti！
Alsi ku nushi ilani mushiti！

05:26.611 --> 05:29.197
Alsi ku nushi ilani!
- [roars]
Alsi ku nushi ilani！
- [咆哮]

05:29.266 --> 05:30.611
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:30.680 --> 05:35.266
Who dares banish me
from this plane?
谁敢驱逐我
从这架飞机？

05:35.335 --> 05:36.956
He started it.
他开始了。

05:37.025 --> 05:38.025
[roars]
[怒吼]

05:38.094 --> 05:39.542
[screams]
No, no, no!
[尖叫声]
不，不，不！

05:39.611 --> 05:42.991
No, no!
不，不！

05:43.059 --> 05:46.197
- Yay, Pigulon is saved!
- Hee-hee!
- 耶，皮古隆得救了！
- 嘻嘻！

05:48.473 --> 05:53.059
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

05:53.128 --> 05:55.266
ScumBob! Putrick!
人渣鲍勃！普特里克！

05:55.335 --> 05:58.508
You blithering fools better
hand over Pigulon
你们这些胡言乱语的傻瓜更好
交出皮古隆

05:58.577 --> 06:03.232
or I'll chug, and I'll glug,
and I'll belch your house down!
或者我会咕噜咕噜，我会咕噜咕噜，
我会把你的房子打下来！

06:03.301 --> 06:06.784
[growls]
- Nobody's home.
[咆哮]
- 没人在家。

06:06.853 --> 06:08.887
Hmm?
[growls]
唔？
[咆哮]

06:08.956 --> 06:12.749
Time for some Fizz Bomb
burp fuel.
是时候来点嘶嘶声炸弹了
打嗝燃料。

06:16.473 --> 06:18.335
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

06:18.404 --> 06:21.163
[belches]
[打嗝]

06:21.232 --> 06:23.542
Ooh.
哦。

06:23.611 --> 06:25.715
Meow.
喵。

06:25.784 --> 06:29.335
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:29.404 --> 06:31.646
I said hand over Pigulon,
我说交出皮古隆，

06:31.715 --> 06:36.577
or I'll chug, and I'll glug,
and I'll belch your house down.
或者我会咕噜咕噜，我会咕噜咕噜，
我会把你的房子打下来。

06:36.646 --> 06:39.094
Again!
- Good luck.
再次！
- 祝你好运。

06:39.163 --> 06:43.439
I built this rock
entirely out of rock.
我建造了这块岩石
完全由岩石制成。

06:43.508 --> 06:45.335
[raspberries]
[覆盆子]

06:45.404 --> 06:47.715
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

06:47.784 --> 06:50.128
Let's turn up the heat.
让我们把热量调高吧。

06:53.439 --> 06:55.404
[belches]
[打嗝]

06:55.473 --> 06:57.404
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

06:57.473 --> 07:00.577
They just don't make rocks
the way they used to.
他们只是不制造石头
就像他们以前那样。

07:00.646 --> 07:02.163
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

07:02.232 --> 07:03.691
- Squidward, Squidward!
- Squid, Squid!
- 章鱼哥，章鱼哥！
- 鱿鱼，鱿鱼！

07:03.715 --> 07:04.794
- Let us in! Come on!
- Squid, Squid!
- 让我们进去吧！快点！
- 鱿鱼，鱿鱼！

07:04.818 --> 07:06.749
- Not interested.
- Waa!
- 不感兴趣。
- 哇！

07:06.818 --> 07:08.922
[groans]
Whoa.
[呻吟]
哇哦。

07:08.991 --> 07:10.784
- Oh, oh!
- [groans]
- 哦，哦！
- [呻吟]

07:10.853 --> 07:12.301
Argh! Hey.
啊！嘿。

07:12.370 --> 07:15.887
What part of "not interested"
don't you understand?
“不感兴趣”的哪一部分
你不明白吗？

07:15.956 --> 07:17.542
Pardon me, Squidward.
请原谅我，章鱼哥。

07:17.611 --> 07:19.577
I'm going to need
that Pigulon doll
我需要
那个皮古隆娃娃

07:19.646 --> 07:21.577
within your residence.
- Argh.
在您的住所内。
- 啊。

07:21.646 --> 07:24.370
I said not interested!
我说没兴趣！

07:24.439 --> 07:25.646
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

07:25.715 --> 07:28.611
Then I'll chug, and I'll glug,
然后我会咕噜咕噜，我会咕噜咕噜，

07:28.680 --> 07:31.646
and I'll belch
your house down too!
我会打嗝
你家也倒了！

07:31.715 --> 07:34.335
[boatmobile beeps]
[船艇嘟嘟声]

07:34.404 --> 07:36.370
[gulps]
[吞咽]

07:43.232 --> 07:45.542
[belches]
[打嗝]

07:45.611 --> 07:46.715
Huh?
啊？

07:46.784 --> 07:49.680
[belches]
[打嗝]

07:49.749 --> 07:51.301
Huh?
啊？

07:51.370 --> 07:53.956
[belches]
[打嗝]

07:54.025 --> 07:56.680
[sighs]
Oh, oh.
[叹气]
哦，哦。

07:56.749 --> 07:58.439
I don't understand.
我不明白。

07:58.508 --> 08:00.749
Those burps should have
rendered his home
那些打嗝应该有
渲染了他的家

08:00.818 --> 08:03.335
into stinky vapors.
化为臭气。

08:03.404 --> 08:04.887
Sorry, Bubble Bass.
对不起，泡泡巴斯。

08:04.956 --> 08:08.025
I just had my house
SpongeBob-proofed.
我刚刚有了我的房子
防海绵宝宝。

08:08.094 --> 08:10.232
[laughs]
[笑]

08:10.301 --> 08:13.232
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:13.301 --> 08:14.370
Hmm.
唔。

08:14.439 --> 08:16.094
[groans]
[呻吟]

08:16.163 --> 08:18.577
With his belching now foiled,
现在他的打嗝已经停止了，

08:18.646 --> 08:22.059
he had but one plan,
他只有一个计划，

08:22.128 --> 08:27.128
fun home to his mommy
and cry like a man.
他妈妈的家很有趣
像个男人一样哭泣。

08:27.197 --> 08:30.991
He wept like a fountain
and lied to the ma'am.
他哭得像喷泉一样
并对女士撒了谎。

08:31.059 --> 08:36.853
Those boys were the bullies,
and he her sweet lamb.
那些男孩是恶霸，
他是她可爱的羔羊。

08:36.922 --> 08:38.887
His mother was livid.
他的母亲非常生气。

08:38.956 --> 08:41.335
She screamed, and she spat,
她尖叫着，吐口水，

08:41.404 --> 08:47.266
"No villain should take
her son's toy like that."
“任何恶棍都不应采取
她儿子的玩具就是这样。”

08:47.335 --> 08:51.956
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:52.025 --> 08:53.680
I am so disappointed.
我很失望。

08:53.749 --> 08:57.197
You should be belching
at a tenth-grade level by now.
你应该打嗝
现在已经是十年级的水平了。

08:57.266 --> 09:00.301
Let Mama show you how it's done.
让妈妈告诉你这是怎么做的。

09:00.370 --> 09:01.646
Here, Mother.
在这里，妈妈。

09:01.715 --> 09:05.335
Oh, I don't need that stuff.
哦，我不需要那些东西。

09:05.404 --> 09:08.163
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

09:08.232 --> 09:09.508
[belches]
[打嗝]

09:09.577 --> 09:12.922
all: Ahh!
全体：啊！

09:12.991 --> 09:16.128
[loud explosion]
[爆炸声]

09:16.197 --> 09:18.577
<i>[breezy upbeat music]</i>
<i>[轻快欢快的音乐]</i>

09:18.646 --> 09:22.680
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:22.749 --> 09:27.094
You boys had better give
my Bubble Bass his toy back.
你们男孩们最好给
我的泡泡鲈鱼他的玩具回来了。

09:27.163 --> 09:30.370
B... but it's our toy.
B...但这是我们的玩具。

09:30.439 --> 09:31.956
I have the receipt.
我有收据。

09:32.025 --> 09:33.784
Hmm.
[gasps]
唔。
[喘气]

09:33.853 --> 09:36.508
Hmm, Bubble Bass!
嗯，泡泡鲈鱼！

09:36.577 --> 09:40.853
M-M-Mama, th-th-that receipt
must be a forgery.
M-M-妈妈，这张收据
一定是伪造的。

09:40.922 --> 09:42.163
[inhales]
[吸气]

09:42.232 --> 09:44.266
No, Mama.
Please!
不，妈妈。
请！

09:44.335 --> 09:47.784
I was just trying to...
- [belches]
我只是想...
- [打嗝]

09:47.853 --> 09:49.715
[gasps, screams]
[喘气，尖叫]

09:49.784 --> 09:51.508
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

09:51.577 --> 09:53.611
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:53.680 --> 09:55.680
Hey, hey, don't cry.
嘿嘿嘿，别哭。

09:55.749 --> 09:57.922
We got something
that might cheer you up.
我们得到了一些东西
这可能会让你高兴起来。

09:59.232 --> 10:01.232
You do?
你做？

10:01.301 --> 10:03.577
Patrick and I want you
to have Pigulon.
帕特里克和我想要你
拥有皮古隆。

10:03.646 --> 10:05.577
[gasps]
Oh, joy!
[喘气]
哦，快乐！

10:05.646 --> 10:06.818
[laughs]
Gimme, gimme, gimme.
[笑]
给我，给我，给我。

10:06.887 --> 10:10.646
- Ha, here you go.
- [laughs]
- 哈，给你。
- [笑]

10:10.715 --> 10:12.404
I know you'll love him.
我知道你会爱他的。

10:12.473 --> 10:16.473
We sure had fun playing
with him.
我们确实玩得很开心
和他在一起。

10:16.542 --> 10:22.163
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:22.232 --> 10:27.301
Well, Bubble Bass won,
so he told himself
嗯，泡泡巴斯赢了，
所以他告诉自己

10:27.370 --> 10:31.853
as he ran home to put
his new doll on the shelf.
当他跑回家放
他的新娃娃在架子上。

10:31.922 --> 10:35.232
Squidward was forced
to rebuild alone.
章鱼哥被迫
独自重建。

10:35.301 --> 10:39.128
His insurance won't cover
belch damage to home.
他的保险不承保
打嗝对房屋造成损害。

10:39.197 --> 10:42.473
[growls]
Hey, your fairy tale did this!
[咆哮]
嘿，你的童话做到了这一点！

10:42.542 --> 10:43.542
Get outta here!
离开这里！

10:43.611 --> 10:44.818
Ahh! Farewell!
啊！告别！

10:44.887 --> 10:46.577
Until next story time!
直到下一个故事时间！

10:46.646 --> 10:48.335
Ahh!
啊！

10:48.404 --> 10:49.404
Hmm?
唔？

唔？